gantt
    dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD
    section Status
    Normal task   : t1, 2026-04-01, 3d
    Active task   : active, t2, 2026-04-01, 3d
    Done task     : done, t3, 2026-04-01, 3d
    Critical task : crit, t4, 2026-04-04, 2d
